ard hand. You are currently in the lead for the match (Hand 19/20), making chip preservation and risk management a priority.\n\nReason: Betting on this texture is risky; you are unlikely to fold out better hands (pairs) and may be raised by strong draws or made hands (sets, two pair, straights), forcing you to fold and lose chips unnecessarily. Checking allows you to control the size of the pot, see a Turn card for free to potentially hit a King or Ace, and avoids bloating the pot while you are out of position with only Ace-high.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
